;; P2 full-batch verification of the salient-noun-coverage lever.
;;
;; P1 (10-question cohort, N=5) was a clear win: never-pooled 11/50 -> 3/50,
;; recall@20 0.47 -> 0.55, with one already-good question (api-04) mildly
;; regressed. This verifies on ALL 42 questions, off vs on, N=3, JUDGED — to
;; confirm a net recall/judge lift AND no regression on the CLEAN-20 that already
;; work (the api-04 risk: does forcing a salient noun hurt already-good questions
;; at scale?). 2 × 42 × 3 = 252 judged runs.
{:configs
 [{:id "off" :skill-graph-id :builtin/agent-rag-graph-bundled :skill-params {}}
